# The changelog is written at release, from the commits
# (tools/release/changelog-collect.sh), so two branches rarely edit it at
# once.  When two do -- a release branch and a straggler -- a union merge
# keeps both sides' lines, in the order ours then theirs, and reports no
# conflict; read the file after such a merge, since the two meet with no
# blank line between them.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
